<h1>Features</h1>
<ul class="feature-list">
  <li>Mandatory registration and login before creating links.</li>
  <li>SEO-friendly slugs composed of rotating keywords and sequential codes.</li>
  <li>Enable or disable links anytime, with expiration options.</li>
  <li>Dashboard with visit counts per link.</li>
  <li>Robust redirect handling with 301/302 support.</li>
  <li>Redis-backed sessions, Postgres for persistence, and Prisma for safety.</li>
</ul>
